Subject: Payment reminder ({{ customer_name }})

Dear {{ customer_name }},

I hope you are well. This is a friendly reminder that the invoice(s) below appear to be past their due date.

{% for inv in invoices -%}
- Invoice {{ inv.invoice_id }}: due {{ inv.due_date }}, {{ inv.days_past_due }} days past due, outstanding {{ inv.outstanding }} {{ currency }}
{% endfor %}
Total overdue: {{ total }} {{ currency }}

If you have already sent payment, thank you, and please disregard this note. Otherwise we would be grateful if you could arrange payment at your convenience.

{% if contact -%}
Contact: {{ contact }}

{% endif -%}
Kind regards,
{{ company_name }}
